__**Parameters of sine wave**__

**1.) Average value**

Vₐvg={2V_mover pi}

Vₐvg=0.637V_m

The average value of the sine wave is 0.637 times the peak value.

2.) RMS value

VRMS={V_mover sqrt{2}}

VRMS=0.707V_m

The RMS value of the sine wave is 0.707 times the peak value.

**3.) Form factor**

FF={VRMSover Vₐvg}

FF={0.707Vₘover 0.637Vₘ}

FF = 1.11

4.) Crest factor

CF={Vₚover VRMS}

CF={Vₘover 0.707Vₘ}

CF = 1.414
